{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17515","headline":"元和元年蒙恩封成纪县伯时室中封安喜县君感庆兼怀聊申贺赠 · 权德舆","name":"元和元年蒙恩封成纪县伯时室中封安喜县君感庆兼怀聊申贺赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啓土封成纪，宜家县安喜。\n同欣井赋开，共受闺门祉。\n珩璜联采组，琴瑟谐宫徴。\n更待悬车时，与君欢暮齿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}